<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS4" title="In Appendix F Implementation Details ‣ Stop-Think-AutoRegress: Language Modeling with Latent Diffusion Planning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.4 </span>Noise-Conditioned MLP</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
